1
00:00:11,320 --> 00:00:13,680
Three, two, one, cheese!

2
00:00:13,880 --> 00:00:15,210
Okay, change your pose.

3
00:00:16,920 --> 00:00:17,480
Ready.

4
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:19,930
One, two, three.

5
00:00:20,680 --> 00:00:22,200
Looks great.

6
00:00:23,200 --> 00:00:23,920
Shen Xi,

7
00:00:23,920 --> 00:00:24,600
we're leaving.

8
00:00:24,600 --> 00:00:25,660
We're heading out.

9
00:00:54,480 --> 00:00:55,320
Shen Xi,

10
00:01:01,800 --> 00:01:02,600
And you are...

11
00:01:02,960 --> 00:01:04,040
I'm Gao Yayan.

12
00:01:04,480 --> 00:01:06,340
I just presented the award to you.

13
00:01:06,640 --> 00:01:07,600
Gao Yayan,

14
00:01:10,400 --> 00:01:11,660
daughter of Gao Yuhai,

15
00:01:12,760 --> 00:01:14,820
the heiress of Wending Group, right?

16
00:01:15,120 --> 00:01:15,840
What?

17
00:01:17,000 --> 00:01:18,640
You want back the few thousand in bonus

18
00:01:18,640 --> 00:01:19,800
you gave me?

19
00:01:20,560 --> 00:01:21,289
Take it back.

20
00:01:24,280 --> 00:01:26,610
You don't need to be
so hostile towards me.

21
00:01:26,760 --> 00:01:28,440
I've been following

22
00:01:28,440 --> 00:01:29,840
the whole competition.

23
00:01:30,800 --> 00:01:31,640
I know

24
00:01:32,200 --> 00:01:33,960
this result is unfair to you.

25
00:01:34,400 --> 00:01:35,320
Fair?

26
00:01:35,520 --> 00:01:38,400
Gao Yuhai's daughter is talking
to me about fairness.

27
00:01:38,400 --> 00:01:39,520
Isn't it ironic?

28
00:01:41,960 --> 00:01:42,800
Sorry,

29
00:01:43,560 --> 00:01:45,420
I have something to do. I gotta go.

30
00:01:46,800 --> 00:01:48,200
I used to study dance too.

31
00:01:49,400 --> 00:01:52,259
Before the entrance exam,
my dad wouldn't let me go.

32
00:01:52,360 --> 00:01:54,200
I broke my ankle jumping off a building

33
00:01:54,200 --> 00:01:55,660
and can never dance again.

34
00:02:00,840 --> 00:02:02,200
So I understand you.

35
00:02:03,560 --> 00:02:05,720
And in a way,

36
00:02:06,400 --> 00:02:08,400
you're actually better off than me.

37
00:02:09,600 --> 00:02:10,720
Can we talk?

38
00:02:24,960 --> 00:02:25,840
That's all.

39
00:02:26,320 --> 00:02:28,600
I completely lost the right to dance.

40
00:02:29,280 --> 00:02:30,400
I went to study

41
00:02:30,640 --> 00:02:33,970
business administration
and architectural engineering.

42
00:02:34,360 --> 00:02:35,680
Your dad is such a

43
00:02:36,240 --> 00:02:36,960
psycho.

44
00:02:42,520 --> 00:02:43,400
I'm sorry.

45
00:02:43,680 --> 00:02:44,880
Please don't mind me.

46
00:02:44,920 --> 00:02:46,720
I just wanted to stand up for you.

47
00:02:47,760 --> 00:02:49,200
You're telling the truth.

48
00:02:49,200 --> 00:02:50,730
You didn't wrong him at all.

49
00:02:51,200 --> 00:02:52,920
So I really envy you.

50
00:02:53,560 --> 00:02:56,560
You can dance freely on stage.

51
00:02:57,280 --> 00:02:59,000
This competition is nothing.

52
00:03:00,400 --> 00:03:02,730
Your future has infinite possibilities.

53
00:03:04,320 --> 00:03:05,920
T-Then what about you now?

54
00:03:06,520 --> 00:03:08,380
Are you working at Wending Group?

55
00:03:09,560 --> 00:03:11,560
I'm not going to work at his company.

56
00:03:12,280 --> 00:03:13,400
Isn't he rich?

57
00:03:13,560 --> 00:03:15,360
Doesn't he love controlling me?

58
00:03:15,720 --> 00:03:17,560
Then I might as well take his money

59
00:03:17,560 --> 00:03:19,160
and do what I like.

60
00:03:21,000 --> 00:03:22,320
Do you still have

61
00:03:22,720 --> 00:03:24,320
dreams about dancing now?

62
00:03:24,680 --> 00:03:25,800
Or any wishes?

63
00:03:26,480 --> 00:03:27,720
Of course I do.

64
00:03:29,360 --> 00:03:30,600
Back then,

65
00:03:31,040 --> 00:03:32,900
because of the art exam incident,

66
00:03:34,400 --> 00:03:35,640
my dad held

67
00:03:35,640 --> 00:03:38,160
this dance competition every year,

68
00:03:39,000 --> 00:03:42,200
claiming it was to make it up to me.

69
00:03:43,120 --> 00:03:45,960
He let me be a judge, a guest,

70
00:03:46,600 --> 00:03:47,860
and the chief planner.

71
00:03:49,400 --> 00:03:50,400
But so what?

72
00:03:52,200 --> 00:03:53,880
None of this means anything.

73
00:03:54,400 --> 00:03:56,120
Because I can't dance anymore,

74
00:03:56,120 --> 00:03:57,760
and that's the truth.

75
00:03:58,520 --> 00:03:59,920
But if you're talking about

76
00:03:59,920 --> 00:04:01,400
my own wish,

77
00:04:02,560 --> 00:04:04,820
I've always wanted to make a dance drama.

78
00:04:05,120 --> 00:04:07,800
There's a little girl in this dance drama.

79
00:04:08,400 --> 00:04:11,440
She's like a little bird, trying

80
00:04:11,880 --> 00:04:12,760
hard

81
00:04:13,680 --> 00:04:14,960
to fly.

82
00:04:16,480 --> 00:04:17,240
But

83
00:04:18,399 --> 00:04:20,959
her wings were cruelly broken
by her father.

84
00:04:23,200 --> 00:04:26,000
You want to make
an autobiographical dance drama.

85
00:04:27,160 --> 00:04:28,760
I guess you could say that.

86
00:04:29,680 --> 00:04:31,080
If it's really possible,

87
00:04:31,080 --> 00:04:32,120
right? Then

88
00:04:32,240 --> 00:04:33,800
I might as well spend Gao Yuhai's money.

89
00:04:33,800 --> 00:04:35,080
That's what I think.

90
00:04:36,760 --> 00:04:37,560
Yayan,

91
00:04:38,520 --> 00:04:39,920
I have a dance drama here.

92
00:04:40,360 --> 00:04:41,560
It was written by a-a

93
00:04:44,120 --> 00:04:45,240
friend of mine.

94
00:04:46,080 --> 00:04:47,340
It's called "Circle".

95
00:04:47,640 --> 00:04:49,640
Although it's not about your story,

96
00:04:49,880 --> 00:04:51,000
I think

97
00:04:51,000 --> 00:04:53,400
the emotion it wants to express
is the same.

98
00:04:53,600 --> 00:04:54,520
I wonder

99
00:04:55,200 --> 00:04:56,460
if you're interested.

100
00:04:58,400 --> 00:04:59,120
Sure.

101
00:04:59,320 --> 00:05:01,600
You can show it to me when you have time.

102
00:05:02,400 --> 00:05:04,000
I'll call him over right now.

103
00:05:13,960 --> 00:05:14,960
Actually,

104
00:05:15,840 --> 00:05:17,800
a woman's intuition is quite accurate.

105
00:05:17,800 --> 00:05:19,160
I was hesitating

106
00:05:19,760 --> 00:05:22,360
whether to introduce
Gao Yayan to Song Yanfei.

107
00:05:22,920 --> 00:05:24,650
For the sake of the dance drama,

108
00:05:24,760 --> 00:05:26,690
the sooner, the better, of course.

109
00:05:27,400 --> 00:05:29,160
But my intuition told me

110
00:05:29,560 --> 00:05:31,000
something might happen

111
00:05:32,360 --> 00:05:34,400
between them.

112
00:05:35,120 --> 00:05:36,480
Didn't Gao Yayan know

113
00:05:36,800 --> 00:05:38,000
he's your boyfriend?

114
00:05:38,480 --> 00:05:39,480
Or

115
00:05:40,120 --> 00:05:40,780
did she know

116
00:05:41,400 --> 00:05:42,860
and just steal him openly?

117
00:05:43,600 --> 00:05:44,680
That's on me.

118
00:05:44,920 --> 00:05:46,880
When I called Song Yanfei,

119
00:05:47,760 --> 00:05:50,560
he was disappointed to hear
I didn't get the bonus.

120
00:05:50,600 --> 00:05:52,159
But he got excited

121
00:05:52,159 --> 00:05:53,320
hearing Gao Yayan was willing to invest,

122
00:05:53,320 --> 00:05:55,159
and came right over with the script.

123
00:05:55,159 --> 00:05:56,320
Before he arrived,

124
00:05:56,600 --> 00:05:59,260
I didn't have time
to explain our relationship.

125
00:06:00,200 --> 00:06:01,400
They had a great chat that day

126
00:06:01,400 --> 00:06:02,800
and basically confirmed

127
00:06:03,120 --> 00:06:04,920
the collaboration on the spot.

128
00:06:05,600 --> 00:06:07,000
On the way back,

129
00:06:07,760 --> 00:06:08,240
Song Yanfei...

130
00:06:08,240 --> 00:06:08,840
045 Song Yanfei

131
00:06:08,840 --> 00:06:09,800
0451 Liang Yanfei

132
00:06:09,800 --> 00:06:11,260
She just made one request.

133
00:06:12,120 --> 00:06:14,560
That's great. That's great.

134
00:06:15,160 --> 00:06:16,720
I knew we could do it.

135
00:06:16,720 --> 00:06:17,680
Thanks to you,

136
00:06:18,000 --> 00:06:20,760
Shen Xi.

137
00:06:21,600 --> 00:06:22,560
This is great.

138
00:06:23,360 --> 00:06:24,960
I really feel like "Circle"

139
00:06:25,560 --> 00:06:26,880
will premiere soon.

140
00:06:28,400 --> 00:06:29,600
Yayan is great.

141
00:06:31,080 --> 00:06:32,200
But...

142
00:06:33,200 --> 00:06:34,120
Her dad

143
00:06:35,560 --> 00:06:36,760
is completely fine.

144
00:06:37,120 --> 00:06:38,600
For rich families like hers,

145
00:06:38,600 --> 00:06:41,080
hundreds of thousands
is just pocket money.

146
00:06:41,200 --> 00:06:41,960
I know it too well.

147
00:06:41,960 --> 00:06:42,890
I've been there.

148
00:06:43,760 --> 00:06:45,760
It's just that there's one thing.

149
00:06:47,159 --> 00:06:48,000
What?

150
00:06:48,600 --> 00:06:50,400
We need to keep our relationship

151
00:06:50,560 --> 00:06:52,290
a secret from Gao Yayan for now.

152
00:06:56,159 --> 00:06:56,840
Why?

153
00:06:57,600 --> 00:06:59,120
Are you going to use your looks

154
00:06:59,120 --> 00:07:00,250
to seduce Gao Yayan?

155
00:07:01,280 --> 00:07:03,540
That's not entirely out of the question.

156
00:07:04,080 --> 00:07:05,000
Then go ahead.

157
00:07:06,640 --> 00:07:07,760
I'm kidding.

158
00:07:07,760 --> 00:07:08,600
How could I?

159
00:07:08,800 --> 00:07:10,400
Just kidding. Just kidding.

160
00:07:10,400 --> 00:07:11,680
I mean,

161
00:07:13,000 --> 00:07:15,660
after the dance drama
premieres successfully,

162
00:07:16,080 --> 00:07:17,410
we can tell her the truth

163
00:07:17,680 --> 00:07:19,120
at the celebration party.

164
00:07:19,120 --> 00:07:20,380
Wouldn't that be nice?

165
00:07:20,480 --> 00:07:21,520
We shouldn't make her feel like

166
00:07:21,520 --> 00:07:23,000
we're teaming up

167
00:07:23,320 --> 00:07:25,000
to scheme for her money.

168
00:07:25,720 --> 00:07:26,980
That would look so bad.

169
00:07:27,760 --> 00:07:28,680
Are you serious?

170
00:07:28,680 --> 00:07:29,560
Of course.

171
00:07:31,800 --> 00:07:32,930
That's more like it.

172
00:07:33,280 --> 00:07:34,340
Give me a kiss then.

173
00:07:38,000 --> 00:07:39,400
Who wants to kiss you?

174
00:07:41,120 --> 00:07:42,280
Song Yanfei, you...

175
00:07:56,600 --> 00:07:57,560
Yanfei,

176
00:07:57,960 --> 00:07:59,200
I just rearranged

177
00:07:59,200 --> 00:08:00,730
the female solo dance part.

178
00:08:00,800 --> 00:08:02,600
The moves are smoother now,

179
00:08:02,600 --> 00:08:04,800
and the emotions are better expressed.

180
00:08:04,960 --> 00:08:05,640
Come on.

181
00:08:06,040 --> 00:08:06,960
Let me show you.

182
00:08:07,720 --> 00:08:08,360
Shen Xi,

183
00:08:11,600 --> 00:08:12,400
what's wrong?

184
00:08:16,920 --> 00:08:17,780
Let's break up.

185
00:08:26,360 --> 00:08:28,400
So you agreed to break up?

186
00:08:28,400 --> 00:08:29,530
What else could I do?

187
00:08:30,600 --> 00:08:32,320
Could I keep him

188
00:08:32,840 --> 00:08:34,440
or his heart?

189
00:08:36,000 --> 00:08:37,330
I didn't argue with him.

190
00:08:37,400 --> 00:08:38,760
I just made one request.

191
00:08:39,760 --> 00:08:41,360
On the day of the premiere,

192
00:08:42,159 --> 00:08:44,000
I must be the one to dance this role.

193
00:08:44,000 --> 00:08:45,640
Consider it a perfect ending

194
00:08:46,280 --> 00:08:47,720
to our relationship

195
00:08:48,880 --> 00:08:50,680
and all these years of hard work.

196
00:08:53,800 --> 00:08:55,660
But there's one thing I don't get.

197
00:08:56,000 --> 00:08:57,400
Why did you wear a mask

198
00:08:57,600 --> 00:08:59,260
and have Bai Sha cover for you?

199
00:09:02,760 --> 00:09:04,690
Because I hit and killed Gao Yuhai.

200
00:09:08,880 --> 00:09:10,120
So

201
00:09:11,080 --> 00:09:11,720
you mean

202
00:09:11,720 --> 00:09:13,650
I can't be the lead dancer anymore?

203
00:09:21,400 --> 00:09:22,440
I'm sorry.

204
00:09:26,600 --> 00:09:28,060
After all, that's her dad.

205
00:09:28,600 --> 00:09:29,400
And you...

206
00:09:37,280 --> 00:09:38,480
But I thought of a way.

207
00:09:39,640 --> 00:09:41,500
You might have to compromise a bit

208
00:09:41,600 --> 00:09:42,760
and wear a mask.

209
00:09:43,280 --> 00:09:44,280
Wear a mask?

210
00:09:46,120 --> 00:09:48,280
I'll arrange for someone

211
00:09:48,880 --> 00:09:49,960
to take your place.

212
00:09:50,560 --> 00:09:51,320
There's a formation

213
00:09:51,320 --> 00:09:53,200
where a group stands together.

214
00:09:53,280 --> 00:09:54,210
I'll pull her out

215
00:09:54,640 --> 00:09:56,240
and let you dance in her spot.

216
00:09:56,520 --> 00:09:58,240
You can do your lifts

217
00:09:58,240 --> 00:09:59,700
and other moves normally.

218
00:09:59,960 --> 00:10:02,360
It's basically like you're still the lead.

219
00:10:02,360 --> 00:10:03,400
Because you know

220
00:10:03,720 --> 00:10:05,280
Xingchen is my best friend.

221
00:10:05,560 --> 00:10:08,120
He's in charge of investigating
your traffic accident.

222
00:10:08,120 --> 00:10:09,980
If he finds out you're performing

223
00:10:10,040 --> 00:10:11,640
and knows about us,

224
00:10:11,640 --> 00:10:12,440
and discovers

225
00:10:14,120 --> 00:10:16,160
you're close to Yayan...

226
00:10:17,520 --> 00:10:19,250
I'm afraid he'll overthink it.

227
00:10:19,280 --> 00:10:20,610
Less trouble is better.

228
00:10:21,760 --> 00:10:22,760
What do you think?

229
00:10:24,240 --> 00:10:25,360
All right.

230
00:10:26,400 --> 00:10:27,800
Let's do as you say.

231
00:10:32,600 --> 00:10:34,240
I'm sorry for putting you through this.

232
00:10:34,240 --> 00:10:35,040
Let's eat.

233
00:10:41,920 --> 00:10:42,560
Let's go.

234
00:10:50,680 --> 00:10:51,480
Thank you.

235
00:10:54,080 --> 00:10:54,880
Captain Li,

236
00:10:55,640 --> 00:10:56,920
about my car...

237
00:10:57,080 --> 00:10:59,400
Bai Xiaosi is suspected
of driving without a license

238
00:10:59,400 --> 00:11:00,200
and evading inspection.

239
00:11:00,200 --> 00:11:01,460
We are dealing with it.

240
00:11:02,160 --> 00:11:03,560
Also, I need to remind you

241
00:11:03,920 --> 00:11:06,440
that you cannot leave Checheng

242
00:11:06,440 --> 00:11:08,240
until you receive our official notice.

243
00:11:08,240 --> 00:11:09,500
If this happens again,

244
00:11:10,000 --> 00:11:11,730
it won't be resolved so easily.

245
00:11:12,280 --> 00:11:13,080
Understood?

246
00:11:14,880 --> 00:11:16,480
I can't hide from you anyway.

247
00:11:17,200 --> 00:11:18,930
I'll wait for your notice then.

248
00:11:19,320 --> 00:11:19,920
Okay.

249
00:11:20,480 --> 00:11:21,280
Get some rest.

250
00:11:21,920 --> 00:11:22,600
Let's go.

251
00:11:24,200 --> 00:11:25,000
Bye.

252
00:11:28,680 --> 00:11:29,360
Wei,

253
00:11:29,920 --> 00:11:31,760
please have someone keep an eye on them.

254
00:11:31,760 --> 00:11:32,560
No problem.

255
00:11:43,360 --> 00:11:43,920
Hey,

256
00:11:44,680 --> 00:11:45,540
are you asleep?

257
00:11:45,960 --> 00:11:47,040
I want to see you.

258
00:11:48,160 --> 00:11:49,800
Here, Officer Jiang.

259
00:11:51,000 --> 00:11:52,920
Try the coffee I ground myself.

260
00:11:53,720 --> 00:11:54,520
Thanks.

261
00:11:55,200 --> 00:11:58,060
Yayan brought these coffee beans
back from Africa.

262
00:12:01,480 --> 00:12:02,840
It's really good.

263
00:12:04,200 --> 00:12:05,680
I really didn't expect

264
00:12:06,400 --> 00:12:07,930
her to tell you everything.

265
00:12:09,440 --> 00:12:10,970
Do you have anything to add?

266
00:12:13,760 --> 00:12:15,200
Nothing to add.

267
00:12:15,920 --> 00:12:16,680
It's just...

268
00:12:18,240 --> 00:12:19,570
what happened back then

269
00:12:19,960 --> 00:12:20,960
dragged you down.

270
00:12:21,240 --> 00:12:22,370
For all these years,

271
00:12:22,880 --> 00:12:24,600
I've been looking for a chance

272
00:12:24,600 --> 00:12:26,260
to apologize to you in person.

273
00:12:26,760 --> 00:12:28,620
But I just couldn't find the right

274
00:12:28,920 --> 00:12:29,720
opportunity.

275
00:12:31,280 --> 00:12:32,210
It's in the past.

276
00:12:32,840 --> 00:12:34,700
About what happened back then...

277
00:12:34,840 --> 00:12:35,840
Professionally,

278
00:12:36,480 --> 00:12:37,560
as a cop,

279
00:12:38,640 --> 00:12:40,120
I failed my duty.

280
00:12:41,560 --> 00:12:42,560
Personally,

281
00:12:43,280 --> 00:12:44,560
we grew up

282
00:12:44,840 --> 00:12:45,880
together, and

283
00:12:46,800 --> 00:12:49,260
I really failed
to take good care of your dad.

284
00:12:50,040 --> 00:12:52,200
That's why I quit being a detective.

285
00:12:54,080 --> 00:12:55,740
You two childhood friends...

286
00:12:56,040 --> 00:12:57,800
Now that everything is out in the open,

287
00:12:57,800 --> 00:12:59,000
there are no more issues,

288
00:12:59,000 --> 00:12:59,680
right?

289
00:13:00,160 --> 00:13:01,960
Let's toast with coffee

290
00:13:02,080 --> 00:13:04,280
to celebrate you two burying the hatchet

291
00:13:04,280 --> 00:13:05,200
and making up.

292
00:13:05,440 --> 00:13:06,640
Cheers.

293
00:13:06,640 --> 00:13:07,970
Why are you everywhere?

294
00:13:08,000 --> 00:13:08,960
Not bad.

295
00:13:09,120 --> 00:13:11,720
Xingchen, your buddy here
is quite something.

296
00:13:12,200 --> 00:13:13,680
He's handsome,

297
00:13:13,840 --> 00:13:15,520
and has both high EQ and IQ.

298
00:13:17,440 --> 00:13:19,800
My childhood friend
has always been outstanding.

299
00:13:19,800 --> 00:13:21,680
You two make a really good team.

300
00:13:22,480 --> 00:13:25,480
I wish you a smooth partnership

301
00:13:26,080 --> 00:13:27,280
and a happy marriage.

302
00:13:28,520 --> 00:13:29,720
Stop messing around.

303
00:13:30,080 --> 00:13:31,540
Enough with the nonsense.

304
00:13:31,600 --> 00:13:32,660
Seriously though,

305
00:13:32,760 --> 00:13:35,600
are you sure there's nothing else to add?

306
00:13:36,720 --> 00:13:37,850
Actually, there is.

307
00:13:38,760 --> 00:13:39,720
When

308
00:13:39,800 --> 00:13:41,400
Yayan and I first got together,

309
00:13:41,400 --> 00:13:44,000
the dance drama had actually
already taken shape.

310
00:13:44,000 --> 00:13:44,680
But

311
00:13:44,920 --> 00:13:46,960
when her dad found out we were together,

312
00:13:46,960 --> 00:13:48,560
he absolutely disapproved.

313
00:13:48,640 --> 00:13:50,640
The dance drama needed funding
at the time,

314
00:13:50,640 --> 00:13:52,120
and Yayan had no other choice

315
00:13:52,120 --> 00:13:53,380
but to go on a blind date

316
00:13:53,440 --> 00:13:55,800
with a guy her dad arranged.

317
00:13:56,600 --> 00:13:57,440
Feng Shu.

318
00:13:57,640 --> 00:13:59,800
Right, the one who framed me.

319
00:14:01,080 --> 00:14:03,080
Later, Yayan made a huge scene

320
00:14:03,400 --> 00:14:04,530
at her dad's funeral

321
00:14:05,120 --> 00:14:07,640
to keep her power in the company

322
00:14:07,920 --> 00:14:09,400
and kick Feng Shu out.

323
00:14:12,600 --> 00:14:13,660
Rich family drama.

324
00:14:14,080 --> 00:14:16,240
It's like a TV show coming to life.

325
00:14:16,400 --> 00:14:17,600
Something like that.

326
00:14:18,480 --> 00:14:20,040
Later I realized

327
00:14:20,560 --> 00:14:23,020
Yayan is much more forgiving
than I thought.

328
00:14:23,080 --> 00:14:25,000
My causing a scene at the premiere

329
00:14:25,360 --> 00:14:26,760
was really unnecessary.

330
00:14:27,760 --> 00:14:28,200
So,

331
00:14:28,360 --> 00:14:30,000
she knows everything

332
00:14:30,360 --> 00:14:31,240
about Shen Xi?

333
00:14:32,160 --> 00:14:32,760
Yes.

334
00:14:35,680 --> 00:14:36,920
I've known for a long time

335
00:14:36,920 --> 00:14:38,760
that Shen Xi is his ex-girlfriend.

336
00:14:38,760 --> 00:14:39,920
I also know

337
00:14:40,480 --> 00:14:41,760
she sacrificed a lot

338
00:14:41,760 --> 00:14:42,960
for this dance drama.

339
00:14:43,360 --> 00:14:44,760
So I can understand

340
00:14:44,880 --> 00:14:46,140
why she can't let it go.

341
00:14:46,840 --> 00:14:49,040
Yanfei explained all this to me clearly

342
00:14:49,120 --> 00:14:51,000
after the three of us first met.

343
00:14:53,920 --> 00:14:55,960
The script and the concept
are both excellent.

344
00:14:55,960 --> 00:14:58,480
Coupled with Director Song's
personal experience,

345
00:14:58,480 --> 00:14:59,320
I believe

346
00:14:59,320 --> 00:15:01,840
this will definitely be a blockbuster.

347
00:15:04,440 --> 00:15:05,520
Thank you, Ms. Gao.

348
00:15:05,520 --> 00:15:08,120
We definitely won't let
your money go to waste.

349
00:15:08,120 --> 00:15:08,980
Yes, thank you.

350
00:15:10,000 --> 00:15:11,080
It's not my money.

351
00:15:11,320 --> 00:15:12,880
And please don't call me Ms. Gao.

352
00:15:12,880 --> 00:15:14,280
It sounds like you're calling my dad.

353
00:15:14,280 --> 00:15:16,280
Just call me Yayan or Yanyan.

354
00:15:21,320 --> 00:15:23,120
Are you two a couple?

355
00:15:25,640 --> 00:15:26,400
No.

356
00:15:26,680 --> 00:15:27,810
Everyone says that.

357
00:15:28,280 --> 00:15:29,320
We're good bros.

358
00:15:29,560 --> 00:15:30,280
Pure bros.

359
00:15:37,440 --> 00:15:39,100
Don't listen to his nonsense.

360
00:15:39,240 --> 00:15:40,560
We're not bros.

361
00:15:41,280 --> 00:15:42,520
We're

362
00:15:43,680 --> 00:15:44,320
besties.

363
00:15:44,880 --> 00:15:45,760
He is

364
00:15:46,160 --> 00:15:47,440
a pure sister.

365
00:15:48,160 --> 00:15:49,220
Yes, pure sisters.

366
00:15:50,320 --> 00:15:51,400
I can tell.

367
00:15:51,680 --> 00:15:53,960
You two truly love each other.

368
00:15:54,320 --> 00:15:55,160
Of course.

369
00:15:56,880 --> 00:15:58,840
And when we were creating
the dance drama later,

370
00:15:58,840 --> 00:16:01,500
many of our ideas were
surprisingly identical.

371
00:16:06,040 --> 00:16:07,000
Still writing...

372
00:16:07,000 --> 00:16:07,600
Thanks.

373
00:16:10,520 --> 00:16:11,280
Look, Yayan.

374
00:16:12,480 --> 00:16:14,560
This is a new character I wrote,

375
00:16:14,560 --> 00:16:15,840
a little girl.

376
00:16:16,240 --> 00:16:19,240
Throughout the play,
she just stands high up on the stage

377
00:16:19,240 --> 00:16:20,240
in a corner,

378
00:16:20,800 --> 00:16:21,440
looking down.

379
00:16:21,440 --> 00:16:23,560
People from all circles pass by her,

380
00:16:23,760 --> 00:16:25,820
yet she doesn't belong to any of them.

381
00:16:26,440 --> 00:16:27,200
Do you know

382
00:16:27,600 --> 00:16:28,800
what she represents?

383
00:16:32,400 --> 00:16:34,880
She represents innate resources,

384
00:16:35,880 --> 00:16:37,080
having powerful backing,

385
00:16:37,080 --> 00:16:38,680
and reaping what others sow.

386
00:16:40,600 --> 00:16:41,480
Oh my god,

387
00:16:41,480 --> 00:16:43,240
you get me so well!

388
00:16:44,280 --> 00:16:46,080
How do you understand me so well?

389
00:16:46,440 --> 00:16:47,240
Seriously,

390
00:16:47,760 --> 00:16:48,640
I used to

391
00:16:49,200 --> 00:16:50,800
discuss scripts with Shen Xi too.

392
00:16:50,800 --> 00:16:53,560
What she liked were
the characters in my scripts.

393
00:16:53,560 --> 00:16:55,480
She liked the pink dresses

394
00:16:55,480 --> 00:16:56,680
and dazzling lights.

395
00:16:57,320 --> 00:16:58,520
She fantasized about

396
00:16:58,560 --> 00:17:01,200
the glamour of standing on stage.

397
00:17:02,240 --> 00:17:03,500
But you're different.

398
00:17:05,599 --> 00:17:08,640
You understand the helplessness
and sorrow in my scripts,

399
00:17:08,640 --> 00:17:09,640
and you can see

400
00:17:11,560 --> 00:17:13,160
the souls of the characters.

401
00:17:14,680 --> 00:17:16,240
We resonate with each other a lot.

402
00:17:16,240 --> 00:17:17,839
I really didn't expect this.

403
00:17:17,920 --> 00:17:20,650
I didn't expect someone
to understand me so well.

